# Production build environment variables:
#
# Case 1: Monorepo / Single Server (Render / Railway / Docker / Express static serve)
# Leave VITE_API_URL blank or unset — frontend automatically connects to same-origin /api.
# VITE_API_URL=
#
# Case 2: Separate Frontend Host (e.g. Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages)
# Set VITE_API_URL to your deployed backend URL.
# Note: Trailing slashes and missing '/api' paths are handled automatically.
# Example:
VITE_API_URL=https://etlobservability-2.onrender.com/api
